Verse"><p begin="1:27.823" end="1:33.813" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.823" end="1:28.091">擦</span><span begin="1:28.214" end="1:28.823">干后</span><span begin="1:28.823" end="1:29.684">的眼</span><span begin="1:29.684" end="1:30.593">泪</span> <span begin="1:31.464" end="1:31.633">我</span><span begin="1:31.633" end="1:32.212">们</span><span begin="1:32.212" end="1:32.352">都</span><span begin="1:32.352" end="1:32.732">说</span><span begin="1:32.732" end="1:33.324">好</span><span begin="1:33.324" end="1:33.813">了</span></p><p begin="1:35.231" end="1:39.772" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.231" end="1:36.121">过了今</span><span begin="1:36.121" end="1:36.602">夜</span> <span begin="1:37.082" end="1:37.869">谁都</span><span begin="1:37.869" end="1:38.481">不</span><span begin="1:38.481" end="1:38.801">后</span><span begin="1:38.801" end="1:39.772">悔</span></p><p begin="1:42.430" end="1:49.312" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.430" end="1:42.641">最</span><span begin="1:42.641" end="1:43.081">后</span><span begin="1:43.081" end="1:43.252">一</span><span begin="1:43.252" end="1:44.380">句再</span><span begin="1:44.380" end="1:45.461">见</span> <span begin="1:46.232" end="1:46.712">再</span><span begin="1:46.712" end="1:46.971">也</span><span begin="1:46.971" end="1:47.621">不</span><span begin="1:47.621" end="1:47.921">留</span><span begin="1:47.921" end="1:49.312">恋</span></p><p begin="1:49.780" end="1:57.109" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.780" end="1:50.376">我</span><span begin="1:50.376" end="1:50.508">的</span><span begin="1:50.508" end="1:51.239">世</span><span begin="1:51.239" end="1:51.489">界</span><span begin="1:51.489" end="1:52.229">停</span><span begin="1:52.229" end="1:52.910">留那</span><span begin="1:53.080" end="1:53.408">瞬</span><span begin="1:53.408" end="1:57.109">间</span></p></div><div begin="1:58.132" end="3:09.948" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:58.132" end="2:04.954" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1">